  "body": "### Changed\n\n- Built-in reasoning defaults are back to their values before 5.1.59: daily mode runs Claude Opus 5.5 at medium effort again, and every other rung raised to high in 5.1.59 returns to its previous medium or xhigh setting. ([#12271](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent/issues/12271)) ([#12272](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent/pull/12272))\n- The `architect` task category can now implement as well as design. Its description and child prompt name broad debugging across many sources (code, logs, git history, issues, docs, configuration, runtime evidence) as a use case, and the child is told it has the full tool set and should carry a requested change through to a verified result. A caller that wants a design write-up without file edits marks the task advisory-only (#12238). Model routing is unchanged. ([#12239](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent/pull/12239))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- The native-binary-parity CI check no longer fails when a leftover task-host shard is still running on one side and has already exited on the other: both doctor lines are runtime state. ([#12148](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent/issues/12148)) ([#12153](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent/pull/12153))\n\n- c636c06e5a Merge pull request #12272 from code-yeongyu/revert/12094-reasoning-defaults\n- dd69a43616 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/dev' into revert/12094-reasoning-defaults\n- b5fd542ba4 Merge pull request #12239 from code-yeongyu/fix/architect-writable\n- 2821fac395 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/dev' into fix/architect-writable\n- e0d74870cf Merge pull request #12259 from code-yeongyu/fix/12256-eq-hermetic-mcp\n- 5177e6fb9e Revert \"Merge pull request #12094 from code-yeongyu/fix/12085-builtin-reasoning-high\"\n- d7f9c82232 Merge pull request #12153 from code-yeongyu/fix/12148-parity-shard-fold\n- 12ec2cd3ea test(qa): re-record EQ E21-E24 linux goldens from the hermetic-MCP harness (#12256)\n- f30147198f fix(qa): count a sandbox-disabled remote MCP as settled in the EQ startup wait (#12256)\n- a708319a0b fix(qa): keep live third-party MCP instructions out of the EQ observation (#12256)\n- a5e1061f11 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/dev' into fix/architect-writable\n- 72a6bae47e Merge pull request #12212 from code-yeongyu/release/v5.1.59-source-state\n- 966fe3d2db Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/dev' into fix/12148-parity-shard-fold\n- f615e62aa1 docs(changes): match the #12239 note to the tightened wording\n- 75a5be4306 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/dev' into fix/architect-writable\n- 11852ded93 docs(changes): note the writable architect category (#12239)\n- 7232c70151 fix(qa): fold INFO and WARN shard doctor lines in the binary/npm parity compare\n\n```bash\nbun add -g omo-ai\n```\n"
